# R-#33: Reorganize the source code in one repository with one private submodule

**Status:** `open`  
**Priority:** `high`  
**Repository:** `stable-sl` (branch `v3`)  
**Date:** 2026-09-08

---

## 📋 Description

Reorganize the source code structure of **stable-sl** into a single repository, integrating `coordinator-stable-sl` as a private submodule at `apps/stable-sl/app/api/`. This reorganization follows the `learn.tg` pattern and facilitates maintenance, deployment, and coordinated development of all components.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

1. **Unify** all code into a single repository (`stable-sl`).
2. **Preserve** the history of `coordinator-stable-sl` as a submodule.
3. **Adopt** the `learn.tg` structure (without Rails) for internal consistency.
4. **Use** `pnpm@10.6.2` with workspaces and catalogs for shared dependencies.
5. **Centralize** environment variables in `apps/.env.example` and `apps/.env`.
6. **Ensure** all components continue to work (frontend, API, contracts).

---

## 📁 Proposed Structure

```
stable-sl/                          # Main repository (branch v3)
├── .gitmodules                     # Submodule: coordinator-stable-sl
├── .gitignore                      # Unified (includes apps/.env)
├── .npmrc                          # pnpm configuration
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml             # Workspace with catalogs
├── package.json                    # Root dependencies
├── pnpm-lock.yaml                  # Unified lockfile
├── AGENTS.md                       # AI agent instructions
├── PRINCIPLES.md                   # Guiding principles
├── ARCHITECTURE.md                 # Global architecture
├── CONTRIBUTING.md                 # Contribution guide
├── README.md                       # Main documentation
├── Makefile                        # Common commands
│
├── apps/
│   ├── .env.example                # ⬅️ Shared environment variables template
│   ├── .env                        # ⬅️ Actual environment (gitignored)
│   │
│   ├── stable-sl/                  # Frontend (Next.js)
│   │   ├── package.json
│   │   ├── next.config.ts
│   │   ├── tsconfig.json
│   │   ├── app/
│   │   │   ├── [lang]/             # Pages (buy, sell, admin)
│   │   │   ├── api/                # ⬅️ SUBMODULE (coordinator-stable-sl)
│   │   │   ├── layout.tsx
│   │   │   └── page.tsx
│   │   ├── components/             # UI (shadcn, etc.)
│   │   ├── lib/                    # Hooks, types, utilities
│   │   ├── providers/              # RainbowKit, Wagmi
│   │   ├── public/
│   │   ├── styles/
│   │   └── bin/                    # Scripts (dev, prod)
│   │
│   └── hardhat/                    # Smart contracts
│       ├── package.json
│       ├── hardhat.config.ts
│       ├── contracts/
│       ├── scripts/
│       └── test/
│
├── gatewaySmsUssd/                 # Gateway APK
│   └── app-debug.apk
│
└── doc/
    ├── img/
    ├── api/
    ├── deployment/
    └── environments.md
```

---

## 🔧 Submodule Configuration

**`.gitmodules`:**
```ini
[submodule "apps/stable-sl/app/api"]
    path = apps/stable-sl/app/api
    url = git@gitlab.com:vtamara/coordinator-stable-sl.git
    branch = main
```

**Commands to add the submodule:**
```bash
cd stable-sl
git submodule add git@gitlab.com:vtamara/coordinator-stable-sl.git apps/stable-sl/app/api
git submodule update --init --recursive
```

---

