## 🔄 File Mapping

| Source | Destination |
|--------|-------------|
| `stable-sl/apps/nextjs/` | `apps/stable-sl/` |
| `stable-sl/apps/hardhat/` | `apps/hardhat/` |
| `coordinator-stable-sl/app/api/` | `apps/stable-sl/app/api/` (submodule) |
| `coordinator-stable-sl/services/` | `apps/stable-sl/app/api/services/` (inside submodule) |
| `coordinator-stable-sl/db/` | `apps/stable-sl/app/api/db/` (inside submodule) |
| `coordinator-stable-sl/drizzle/` | `apps/stable-sl/app/api/drizzle/` (inside submodule) |
| `stable-sl/gatewaySmsUssd/` | `gatewaySmsUssd/` |
| `stable-sl/apps/.env.template` | `apps/.env.example` (renamed) |

---

## ✅ Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] The `stable-sl` repository exists with branch `v3`.
- [ ] `coordinator-stable-sl` is added as a submodule at `apps/stable-sl/app/api/`.
- [ ] `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and root `package.json` are configured.
- [ ] `apps/.env.example` contains all environment variables.
- [ ] `apps/.env` is created from `.env.example` (ignored by Git).
- [ ] `pnpm install` runs without errors.
- [ ] `pnpm build` compiles frontend, API, and contracts.
- [ ] `pnpm dev` starts frontend and API in parallel.
- [ ] Submodule reads environment from `apps/.env` (up one level).
- [ ] Structure follows the `learn.tg` pattern.
- [ ] Documentation (`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`) is updated.
- [ ] `AGENTS.md` and `PRINCIPLES.md` are present.

